WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.270
<b>Ooezo Agricultural High School Festival</b>

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Equestrian Club 
 </b>9/30 Day 1, 12:00 PM onwards 
 Jumping competition at the 
equestrian club grounds! 
 2:00 PM onwards 
 Banba Racing 
 Field 3

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.980
<b>Holstein 
 Cow 
Beauty Pageant</b>

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.690
<b>Equestrian Club 
 9/30 Day 1, 12:00 PM onwards 
 Jumping competition at the 
equestrian club grounds</b>

00:00:06.910 --> 00:00:08.690
Hachiken collapsed?!

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.140
Why?

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.410
They don't know yet,

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:16.030
but it sounds like he was 
working himself too hard.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:18.420
Tokiwa found him this morning

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:19.870
when he showed up to walk the dog.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:25.580
The paramedics weren't acting like 
his life was danger, right?

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:26.670
Yeah...

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:33.180
My, my, my.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:35.590
I came all the way here because
 I heard there'd be a jumping event,

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.010
but the arena's so tiny!

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:44.690
It seems it wasn't worth 
my coming here, Mikage Aki!

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.780
And, Jyuuhachiken...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.440
Wait, where is he?

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.740
No one here by that name.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:50.900
Nope.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:52.130
What?

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.320
He collapsed?

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.190
What an idiot!

00:00:55.190 --> 00:00:58.110
He's not taking proper care of himself!

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.830
Yeah, you're right, but...

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:02.840
He was just doing his best!

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.000
He was trying really hard 
to make the event a success!

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:11.050
Arguing here won't really 
accomplish anything.

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:14.100
We shouldn't let the horses 
sense how anxious we are.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:16.170
Or the horses might get anxious, too.

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.890
"I want to show how cool horses are."

00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:24.860
"I want people to have fun."

00:01:26.180 --> 00:01:26.980
Ayame-chan!

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.270
What?

00:01:29.510 --> 00:01:31.340
I'd like your help.

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:32.360
Please.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.090
Oh, hey, Dad?

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.010
Sorry if I'm bothering you at work.

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:46.370
I'm at Ezonoo right now.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:51.580
Can you have my horse, DeRoyal, 
and my riding gear sent over?

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:24.470
<b>Ooezo Agricultural High School Festival</b>

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:26.430
<b>Fall Chapter Episode 6
Mikage 
Gives It Her All</b>

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:26.430
Fifty daikon radishes, please.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.930
Done!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.930
Sold Out

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.420
Smoked chicken's sold out!

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:28.930
Aww...

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.590
Want shaved ice from the karate club?!

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:32.850
Hup!

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.620
Where am I...

00:03:39.970 --> 00:03:41.130
Are you awake?

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:42.250
You're in the hospital.

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:47.400
You don't have to get up!

00:03:48.090 --> 00:03:50.860
What... happened to me?

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.430
You fainted from fatigue.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.880
Fainted?

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:56.680
What's the date and time?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.980
September 30th, 1:20 PM.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:01.640
I have to go!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.530
All right. Don't be a superhero.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.570
You can't go home today.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.440
You'll recover quickly 
because you're still young,

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.680
but you have to rest right now.

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.280
That's the nurse call button 
if you need anything.

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.040
The bathroom's out the hall 
and all the way to the right.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:25.320
Um...

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:29.050
Did anyone visit me while I was out?

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:30.970
Oh, there was someone.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:32.820
He looked like a school teacher.

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:35.370
He left a note for you.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.380
I'll visit again later. 
 -Sakuragi

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:39.930
Any students?

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.590
Nope, no one.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.210
I need to pee...

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:08.980
Wow!

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:11.800
I've only seen horses in a normal race.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.090
This feels new!

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:14.540
Looks really fun!

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:19.120
Next up is a guest competitor 
from West Shimizu High School.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:21.850
Minamikujou-san and DeRoyal.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:26.640
Wow!

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:27.520
What a show!

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.880
How's she staying on her horse?!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.560
She still doesn't give 
a damn about the rules...

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:34.480
You're over time.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.060
What?

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:36.660
Too bad!

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:40.170
It seems the time for you
 to behold my beauty is over.

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:41.080
I want more!

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.260
You haven't even jumped half of them!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.630
Thank you, thank you!

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:43.860
That was fun!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.180
Good job!

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.820
More applause, please!

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.740
Hey, can I go yet?

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:51.480
Next up is Ookawa-kun and Ebisu.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:52.450
Start.

00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:58.000
Oh, a refusal!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.290
Oh, another one!

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:03.220
The horse stopped twice, so I 
guess that's a disqualification.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:03.800
Yeah.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:06.800
Ookawa-kun and Ebisu have been disqualified.

00:06:12.990 --> 00:06:15.990
Oh, they still jumped even 
after being disqualified.

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:19.360
But they didn't jump the 
remaining gates and left.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.680
They were disqualified, right?

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:24.490
Yeah, that's what the rules say.

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:27.640
But if you leave without 
jumping the obstacle,

00:06:27.640 --> 00:06:29.280
the horse might lose his confidence.

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.950
He might think he's useless and 
become scared of jumping.

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:35.560
So if there's time to spare,

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:37.870
they do their best to give 
the horse another chance.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.750
Good job!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.400
That sucked!

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:44.000
But I guess there are bad days.

00:06:44.610 --> 00:06:47.720
That tells the horse that he
 can still jump, even after failing.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:59.840
It seems Ooezo Agricultural 
High School isn't a good fit for you.

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.650
You can't even maintain your own health.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.440
And this is the school you chose?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.700
Wh-Who gave you the right to decide

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:12.020
whether it's a good fit for me?

00:07:12.440 --> 00:07:16.280
Sure, it's tough when there's a 
lot of manual labor involved,

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:20.430
b-but I'm glad I came to Ezonoo.

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:21.330
I see.

00:07:22.260 --> 00:07:25.890
You've always liked studying books.

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:28.370
I figured having you attend 
a school where you could

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.090
do what you liked would be best for you.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.160
At prep school,

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:40.440
I couldn't help but think of 
my classmates as competitors.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.520
I hated that!

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:47.930
At Ezonoo, everyone does things
 at their own pace,

00:07:47.930 --> 00:07:49.660
so I don't have to think that way.

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:52.740
I made a lot of friends I can 
just relax and have fun with!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:57.660
Is that because you don't have to worry 
about them outscoring you?

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:02.040
Maybe you're just relieved because
 a part of you is looking down on them.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.590
And have any of those 
friends come to visit you?

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:16.440
Oh, Hachiken!

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.510
Should you be up yet?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:18.890
Sensei!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.180
This is my father.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:23.840
This is my homeroom teacher, 
Sakuragi-sensei.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.690
Thank you for taking care of my son.

00:08:26.090 --> 00:08:27.520
I'm Sakuragi, his homeroom teacher.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.310
I am sorry this happened

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:33.990
because of insufficient 
oversight on our part.

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:35.860
Indeed.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.820
I have been informed that he collapsed due to fatigue

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:40.700
from the school festival preparations.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.380
You allowed a student at a learning institution

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.500
to collapse from activities unrelated to his studies.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.080
Do you realize how preposterous that is?

00:08:48.350 --> 00:08:50.010
You are entirely correct.

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:53.570
If only I had been able to be more 
careful about Hachiken-kun's health,

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.020
this could have been avoided.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:57.950
I-I'm the one who collapsed!

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:59.390
He has nothing to do with this!

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:01.890
No, I do.

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:03.700
Your father is correct.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.400
Hachiken, you were working 
so hard on making preparations.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:10.540
I'm sorry I couldn't make sure 
you got to be at the festival.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:14.110
Think of this as an opportunity.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:16.350
Get checked over from head to toe.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:18.800
Get discharged only after 
you're fully recovered.

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:20.840
I'm going home now.

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:22.800
I've asked Misako to handle the rest.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:24.950
Mom's here, too?

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:28.730
But you've come all this way.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:29.960
Why not stay a while longer—

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:31.420
I have work to do.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.130
I'll be going now.

00:09:33.190 --> 00:09:34.090
Dad!

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:40.890
You don't seem to like the 
fact that I came to Ezonoo,

00:09:41.910 --> 00:09:43.060
but the bacon...

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:45.850
The bacon I made...

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:47.770
You said it was good!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:49.770
You accepted it!

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:52.650
Bacon?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:58.680
Oh, that.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:02.010
What do you mean, I accepted it?

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.540
I didn't make any comments 
about how it tasted.

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:14.060
Sensei, please take good care of my son.

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:15.130
Oh... Yes!

00:10:32.700 --> 00:10:33.810
What <i>is</i> this?!

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:35.790
Human Banba. Didn't you know?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.120
I do, but...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.390
Oh, Komaba Ichirou.

00:10:39.390 --> 00:10:41.220
Hey, been a while.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.900
Wait, why are <i>you</i> the rider?!

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:45.800
What?

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.660
But no one else would do it.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.550
I'll be the rider for this one, then!

00:10:52.030 --> 00:10:54.030
There's no way I'd be...

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.010
the "horse"...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:58.220
Start!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:01.780
That horse is so huge!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:02.620
Go, humans!

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:03.640
Good going!

00:11:03.640 --> 00:11:06.730
Hey! Pull your weight!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:08.810
We're falling behind Mikage Aki!

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:10.850
Easy for you to say!

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.420
Guys, if you win,

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:15.090
I'll give you 5,000 yen 
worth of food tickets!

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:15.900
Ow!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:21.480
Go, go, go!

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.030
Go, humans!

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:25.190
No way horses would lose!

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:30.350
Now recruiting challengers 
to the human Banba race!

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:34.340
Winners will be presented with 
special cheese from Nakajima-sensei!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.230
Me!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.230
Me!

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.880
Wh-What?! No way!

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:42.270
My precious, precious darlings...

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.510
Crap!

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.370
It's Todoroki-sensei!

00:11:46.900 --> 00:11:48.190
Stop!

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:50.230
Mikage-san, now's the time to go all out!

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:51.630
Doing great!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.310
Go, go!

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:55.900
I'll come back later. 
 Sakuragi

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:02.360
<b>Ooezo Kousei Hospital</b>

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.780
It seems I'm in good health.

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.110
Great, glad to hear it!

00:12:09.390 --> 00:12:12.590
Hachiken, you'll go straight 
back to campus, right?

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:15.330
Since you couldn't go yesterday,

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.760
you should enjoy the second day.

00:12:20.660 --> 00:12:21.760
My glasses!

00:12:22.410 --> 00:12:25.610
Right, I have to fix my glasses. 
I can't do anything without them.

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.630
I'll go by a glasses store before I go back!

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:28.640
Okay.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.560
I'll go back first, then.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:33.240
I'll go with you.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.300
I'm fine by myself!

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.750
It's fine.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:37.460
You don't have any money on you, right?

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:41.530
Your school...

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:43.410
How is it?

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:45.770
How? Normal, I guess.

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:50.420
So it's normal to work so hard at festival
 preparations that you collapse?

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:51.910
It is!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:58.750
Why'd did you lie to me about 
Dad saying my bacon was good?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.110
It wasn't a lie!

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:05.130
Remember how your Dad doesn't really 
comment on food at all?

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:09.140
He was silent when he 
ate your bacon, so...

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:13.520
So... I thought that meant he 
was positive about it... right?

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:17.480
I wish you had just told me the truth

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:19.730
instead of bending over backwards 
to make me feel better.

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:22.680
I'm getting out.

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:23.150
What?

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:26.630
Yuugo!

00:13:26.630 --> 00:13:28.040
I'll go to the glasses store on my own.

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:29.080
But...

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.620
I'm going on my own!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.300
Wait a minute!

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:33.700
Jeez...

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.640
At least take this!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:46.880
<b>Payment 
</b>Hachiken-dono

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:53.540
Damn it...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.020
<b>Ooezo Glasses Emporium</b>

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.810
Here's your change.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:04.610
Donations for Victims of the 
Great East Japan Earthquake

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.610
Please put all of it into the donation box.

00:14:04.850 --> 00:14:05.690
What?

00:14:06.690 --> 00:14:08.490
Thank you for your business!

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:14.950
I donated my bus money, too.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:17.350
Oh, well...

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:38.270
<b>Ooezo Agricultural High School Festival</b>

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:38.270
<i>The Ezonoo Festival has now concluded.</i>

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:39.950
So tired.

00:14:38.620 --> 00:14:41.480
<i>Thank you for coming.</i>

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:41.480
It's over.

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:43.940
Can we eat the leftovers?

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.900
The pizza was great!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.820
I hope they'll do it again.

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:55.290
The arena's all gone...

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.600
Oh, Hachiken.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.350
They let you come back?

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.870
Yes, it was just fatigue.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.550
Oh, that's good to hear.

00:15:05.790 --> 00:15:08.690
Um, how was the club event?

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:11.570
Oh, it went off without a hitch.

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:13.800
Oh, okay.

00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:15.900
We're going to have an after party,

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.060
so go wait in the club room.

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.200
Nah, I couldn't do anything!

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:23.270
I don't deserve to go to the after party...

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.110
Just go to the club room!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.440
O-Okay!

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:32.660
Man, she's not being nice to 
someone who's still recovering.

00:15:34.820 --> 00:15:35.740
Oh.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.300
Um, uh...

00:15:40.930 --> 00:15:41.670
I'm back.

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:47.760
<i>She looked away!</i>

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:50.970
<i>I bet she's thinking she doesn't want 
to see me when I ended up being useless!</i>

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:53.590
<i>Right?</i>

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:56.260
<i>Phew, I'm so glad.</i>

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.540
<i>He's all right.</i>

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.120
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.310
I think I'll go.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:04.540
I don't really deserve to be here, anyway...

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.360
What?!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:06.620
Wait, why?!

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:08.010
Let's have the after party!

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:11.320
How can I face everyone?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:15.330
I'm basically Tokugawa Hidetada...

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:18.790
The man who didn't make it in 
time to the Battle of Sekigahara.

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.710
Hide-who?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.830
Mikage, is Japanese history 
a weak subject for you?

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:27.110
Like I said, I'm not good 
at studying in general.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:30.600
Right.

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:34.480
This is how I've been looking down on 
you guys for not being able to study.

00:16:34.480 --> 00:16:36.930
I get why you guys wouldn't like me...

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.470
Where'd that come from?!

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.980
I mean, no one came to visit me...

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.170
No one could leave their 
festival posts during the day,

00:16:45.170 --> 00:16:48.250
and the hospital doesn't 
allow visitors at night.

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:50.730
And this!

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.610
Your notes!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:54.090
Because you left this behind,

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:55.450
we could wrap things up 
without having any issues!

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:02.010
We knew how hard you'd been working for this,

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:04.350
so we wanted to make it work, no matter what!

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:05.960
We didn't want to let you down!

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:09.530
Of course we wanted to go visit you.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:14.020
But when we thought about 
what you'd want the most,

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:16.250
we decided it'd be best for us to do what

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:18.720
we could and see 
things through to the end.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.310
I see.

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:21.920
I guess so.

00:17:23.840 --> 00:17:26.080
I feel silly for sulking.

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:27.690
Thanks.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:32.860
Mikage, did you enjoy the jumping 
and Banba racing events?

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.570
Yeah! Wicked fun!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.130
Oh, no! Forget what I just said!

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:40.870
It was super fun!

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.720
Oh, by the way...

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:58.120
We kind of took liberties with 
the rest of your notebook.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.140
Guestbook 
Please write anything about 
the event you'd like. 
 Equestrian Club

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:00.530
A guestbook?

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:04.540
We left it out so people could 
write whatever they felt like.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:10.270
<b>I guess this is as good as it gets for high school students. 
 I thought it'd be more impressive.
 Kind of disappointed.</b>

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.270
Wow, seriously?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:12.020
It doesn't pull any punches.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.810
Hmm, some of this is warranted.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.170
Guess we'll have to do better next time.

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.160
<b>The surprise contestant was really fun! 
The white horse was awesome! 
 (I had a lot of fun!)</b>

00:18:19.880 --> 00:18:21.160
"Surprise contestant"?

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:25.790
Ayame-chan came to help liven things up.

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:29.330
She's a good person in her own way.

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:37.300
The Banba race was awesome. 
I bet it wasn't easy to make the racetrack. 
 Good work.

00:18:30.620 --> 00:18:32.080
Wow...

00:18:32.080 --> 00:18:34.280
There's so much written here.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:36.650
I guess everyone came to see our event.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:44.680
I'd been kind of down lately, 
 but seeing the horse working so hard 
to draw the sled cheered me up.

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.640
Thank you.

00:19:06.050 --> 00:19:08.550
Sorry, I'm fine.

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:12.570
I'm just happy.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.800
Good job, Hachiken-kun.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.230
Uh, so let us celebrate my glory

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.720
and your efforts to support me,

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:38.060
as well as the worthless Ichiken—

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:39.110
It's Hachiken!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:40.550
Cheers!

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:41.780
Cheers!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.330
Why is an outsider taking the lead?!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.770
Don't get full of yourself 
just because you got to

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:49.330
show off in the Banba race, Mikage Aki!

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.310
Hey, Hachi.

00:19:52.310 --> 00:19:53.230
You all right?

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:53.920
Hey!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:57.090
Sorry I left you guys 
hanging without my help...

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:58.790
No worries!

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:02.180
I just brought a li'l something 
since I heard you were back.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:06.970
The potato rejects?

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.980
<b>Natural Sea Salt</b>

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:12.890
Here.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.470
Thanks for the food!

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:20.530
Yum!

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:21.630
Yummy!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:22.840
New potatoes!

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.720
The crispy skin's so good!

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:28.740
Even rejects can become this tasty...

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:30.200
Scary.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:35.300
Of course the large, shapely ones 
fetch a better price at the market,

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:39.630
but rejects have their 
own way of getting even.

00:20:40.110 --> 00:20:43.370
<i>So even though they couldn't 
grow any larger after trying,</i>

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:45.550
<i>it all depends on how 
things go from there...</i>

00:20:45.900 --> 00:20:48.650
Hey! I thought I smelled something good!

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:49.740
Sure, eat up.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:50.770
There's a ton.

00:20:51.150 --> 00:20:53.500
Hey, Hachiken's back!

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.100
You okay?!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.180
Somehow.

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:58.460
Tokiwa, I heard you called the ambulance.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:20:59.870
Thanks.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:03.150
I'll tell everyone Hachiken's back!

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:05.700
Don't bother, Tokiwa!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:08.920
Oh, where's Nakajima-sensei?

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:10.700
I haven't seen him around.

00:22:45.710 --> 00:22:50.300
This story is a work of fiction.
